    {"defect": "last_digit_power: gloss 'multiplied by itself E times' (116 of 140 keys change under the literal reading) [R-4]", "disposition": "FIXED in power_remainder_r2: 'the product of E factors, each equal to B'; the literal-reading solver from the text agrees with every key.", "test": "test_m0_m1_rev2_wording.py::test_power_remainder_wording_is_unambiguous_and_has_no_even_exponent_artefact"},
