    {"defect": "min_cost_packs: greedy 0.41-0.46; redraws on five naive plans [R-1]", "disposition": "NOT REGISTERED (see lineages_m1_rev2.NOT_REGISTERED): redraws withdrawn; the best constructed variant (equal unit prices, four or five packs) is still beaten by the continuous relaxation at 0.65."},
    {"defect": "mode_tally: 'last value listed' 0.27-0.41; redraw on 'first repeated value'", "disposition": "FIXED BY CONSTRUCTION: one mode, 2-4 rivals with one occurrence fewer, a long tail, then shuffled; no redraw. Measured worst 0.27 (L0, 'ceil(n / distinct) + 1' for the count ask) against a constant rate of 0.15; 'last value' is below that."},
